@host = http://localhost:5080
@aliceId = 20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@bobId = 20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002
@missingId = 99999999-9999-9999-9999-999999999999

### REST Client keeps the cookie in memory; never copy its value into this file.
### Supply SeedUsers__Password in the IDE process environment.
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"userName":"alice","password":"{{$processEnv SeedUsers__Password}}"}

### A-02: 200, own details
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/{{aliceId}}

### A-03: 404 after fix; 200 in the controlled before state
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/{{bobId}}

### A-10: same 404 status, Content-Type and body except correlation fields
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/{{missingId}}

### A-05: own incidents only
GET {{host}}/api/incidents

### A-04: 404; Bob's saved state must remain unchanged (fixed state only)
PUT {{host}}/api/incidents/{{bobId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"forbidden","description":"Заборонене редагування чужого інциденту."}

### A-04: 404; fixed state only
DELETE {{host}}/api/incidents/{{bobId}}

### A-06/A-09: 403, unchanged status; audit trace matches response
POST {{host}}/api/incidents/{{aliceId}}/triage

### A-08b: 400; content, owner, role and status unchanged
PUT {{host}}/api/incidents/{{aliceId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"forged","description":"forged","ownerUserId":"10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002","role":"Analyst","status":"Triaged"}

### A-12: 404, comment on Bob's incident
GET {{host}}/api/incident-comments/30000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002

### A-12: 404, internal comment on Alice's own incident
GET {{host}}/api/incident-comments/30000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003

### Switch the in-memory session to Morgan
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"userName":"morgan","password":"{{$processEnv SeedUsers__Password}}"}

### A-03R: 200, internal comment included
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/{{aliceId}}

### A-12: 200 for Analyst
GET {{host}}/api/incident-comments/30000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003

### A-07 uses a disposable New incident and checks history in the automated test.
### The seed Alice incident is Triaged, so a repeat transition must return 403.
POST {{host}}/api/incidents/{{aliceId}}/triage

### End session
POST {{host}}/api/auth/logout

### A-01: 401, no redirect
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/{{aliceId}}
